{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Salvage Unlimited</strong>, you\u2019re the captain, owner, and operator of a small salvage company trying to make it big on the open water. Grow your business from a single boat and a handful of small contracts into a thriving fleet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ship\u2019s sonar to scan the depths and uncover valuable salvage hidden beneath the waves. Haul your finds back to port and complete contracts to keep your company afloat. Every successful job earns you cash and opens the door to new opportunities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your boats to improve speed, handling, sonar range, and storage capacity. Expand your fleet and take on bigger contracts that bring higher risks and even greater rewards.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3961130?t=1757384248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961130/b0b91f5b96700dc822be4b8137bc2817ac9bc3b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757384248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961130/0ed13f597555df647c1e89c3472cfc6d37079c7c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757384248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3961130/0ed13f597555df647c1e89c3472cfc6d37079c7c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757384248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Salvage Unlimited</strong>, you\u2019re the captain, owner, and operator of a small salvage company trying to make it big on the open water. Grow your business from a s